{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34179","headline":"杂讽九首 四 · 陆龟蒙","name":"杂讽九首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赤舌可烧城，谗邪易爲伍。\n诗人疾之甚，取俾投豺虎。\n长风吹窾木，始有音韵吐。\n无木亦无风，笙簧由喜怒。\n女娲链五石，天缺犹可补。\n当其利口衔，罅漏不复数。\n元精遗万类，双目如牖户。\n非是既相参，重瞳亦爲瞽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34179.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34179","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}